## Windows build flags for plant.
##
## On macOS/Linux, plant's undefined XAD `Tape` symbols (from odelia's compiled
## ODE Solver) are resolved at *load* time against odelia's globally-loaded DLL
## (see odelia's `.onLoad` / odelia#28 and odelia's ARCHITECTURE.md), so the
## plain src/Makevars needs no odelia on the link line.
##
## Windows mingw `ld` forbids undefined symbols in a DLL, so that runtime trick
## cannot apply here: plant.dll must resolve odelia's `Tape` symbols at *link*
## time. We link directly against odelia's single compiled DLL (which exports
## the XAD Tape runtime), keeping one shared copy of `Tape`/`active_tape_` in the
## process. Tracked upstream in traitecoevo/odelia#29.

CXX_STD = CXX20
PKG_CPPFLAGS = -isystem../inst/include/

## odelia's compiled DLL lives under its installed, arch-specific libs dir.
ODELIA_LIBS = $(shell "${R_HOME}/bin/Rscript" -e "cat(system.file('libs', .Platform$$r_arch, package='odelia'))")
PKG_LIBS = "$(ODELIA_LIBS)/odelia.dll"

## Link to gperftools profiler
## Uncomment next line if you want to use the profiler.
## PKG_LIBS += -lprofiler
